From 64a0597dd13f5e99d402aa5fbe9826849a5ee876 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cristian Ciocaltea <cristian.ciocaltea@collabora.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Feb 2024 22:21:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] gitlab-ci: Enable support for ANX7580

This is the Analogix ANX7580 to MIPI DSI bridge found on Steam Deck OLED
model.

Signed-off-by: Cristian Ciocaltea <cristian.ciocaltea@collabora.com>
Signed-off-by: Henry Paradiz <henry.paradiz@gmail.com>
---
 .config-fragment | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.config-fragment b/.config-fragment
index db4b6c23c39c..8e7d6ad8aa78 100644
--- a/.config-fragment
+++ b/.config-fragment
@@ -29,3 +29,5 @@ CONFIG_LTRF216A=y
 CONFIG_ATH11K=y
 CONFIG_ATH11K_PCI=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_MICHAEL_MIC=y
+
+CONFIG_DRM_ANALOGIX_ANX7580=y
-- 
2.55.0

